{"seq":2,"slug":"tcp-udp-and-websocket","title":"TCP、UDP 与 WebSocket","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/networking-and-protocols/tcp-udp-and-websocket","wordCount":885,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"tcp-udp-与-websocket\">TCP、UDP 与 WebSocket</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传输层的核心权衡是<strong>可靠性 vs 延迟</strong>。三种协议分别占据了这条权衡轴上的不同位置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>TCP</strong>：面向连接的可靠字节流——三次握手建连、四次挥手断连，靠序列号、确认应答、超时重传、滑动窗口、拥塞控制保证有序送达。</li>\n<li><strong>拥塞控制</strong>：慢启动（指数增长）→ 拥塞避免（线性增长），丢包时超时则重置窗口、三次重复 ACK 则快恢复（窗口减半）。</li>\n<li><strong>UDP</strong>：无连接、无可靠性保证、无拥塞控制，头部仅 8 字节——适合容忍丢包的实时场景（游戏、视频、VoIP、DNS）。</li>\n<li><strong>WebSocket</strong>：通过 HTTP 升级握手（101 Switching Protocols）在 TCP 之上建立全双工通道，是聊天、游戏、协作编辑的首选。</li>\n<li><strong>四种实时通信方案</strong>：短轮询、长轮询、SSE（服务端→客户端）、WebSocket（双向），延迟与服务器资源开销依次递增。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tcp-可靠的字节流\">TCP：可靠的字节流</h2><p>TCP（Transmission Control Protocol）是互联网最核心的传输层协议。它提供面向连接的、可靠的、有序的字节流传输。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三次握手\">三次握手</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;&#10;    Note over C,S: TCP 三次握手&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: SYN (seq=x)&#10;    Note over C: SYN_SENT&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: SYN-ACK (seq=y, ack=x+1)&#10;    Note over S: SYN_RECEIVED&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: ACK (ack=y+1)&#10;    Note over C,S: ESTABLISHED&#10;    Note over C,S: 连接建立完成,可以传输数据\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务器\n\n    Note over C,S: TCP 三次握手\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: SYN (seq=x)\n    Note over C: SYN_SENT\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: SYN-ACK (seq=y, ack=x+1)\n    Note over S: SYN_RECEIVED\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: ACK (ack=y+1)\n    Note over C,S: ESTABLISHED\n    Note over C,S: 连接建立完成,可以传输数据</pre><p>三次握手的目的是双方确认彼此的发送和接收能力，并同步初始序列号。这个过程需要 1.5 个 RTT（往返时间），在高延迟网络中会显著影响连接建立速度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四次挥手\">四次挥手</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;&#10;    Note over C,S: TCP 四次挥手&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: FIN&#10;    Note over C: FIN_WAIT_1&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: ACK&#10;    Note over C: FIN_WAIT_2&#10;    Note over S: CLOSE_WAIT&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;S: 处理剩余数据&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: FIN&#10;    Note over S: LAST_ACK&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: ACK&#10;    Note over C: TIME_WAIT(等待 2MSL)&#10;    Note over S: CLOSED&#10;    Note over C: CLOSED\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务器\n\n    Note over C,S: TCP 四次挥手\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: FIN\n    Note over C: FIN_WAIT_1\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: ACK\n    Note over C: FIN_WAIT_2\n    Note over S: CLOSE_WAIT\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: 处理剩余数据\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: FIN\n    Note over S: LAST_ACK\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: ACK\n    Note over C: TIME_WAIT(等待 2MSL)\n    Note over S: CLOSED\n    Note over C: CLOSED</pre><h3 id=\"tcp-的可靠性机制\">TCP 的可靠性机制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>序列号</td>\n<td>每个字节都有编号，保证数据有序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>确认应答</td>\n<td>接收方确认已收到的数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时重传</td>\n<td>未收到确认则重新发送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>控制发送速率，避免接收方溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拥塞控制</td>\n<td>慢启动、拥塞避免、快重传、快恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验和</td>\n<td>检测传输中的数据损坏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"拥塞控制\">拥塞控制</h3><p>TCP 的拥塞控制是其最精妙也最影响性能的机制：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[慢启动&lt;br/&gt;指数增长] --&gt;|达到阈值| B[拥塞避免&lt;br/&gt;线性增长]&#10;    B --&gt;|检测到丢包| C{丢包类型}&#10;    C --&gt;|超时| D[重置窗口&lt;br/&gt;回到慢启动]&#10;    C --&gt;|三次重复 ACK| E[快恢复&lt;br/&gt;窗口减半]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;    D --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[慢启动&lt;br/&gt;指数增长] --&gt;|达到阈值| B[拥塞避免&lt;br/&gt;线性增长]\n    B --&gt;|检测到丢包| C{丢包类型}\n    C --&gt;|超时| D[重置窗口&lt;br/&gt;回到慢启动]\n    C --&gt;|三次重复 ACK| E[快恢复&lt;br/&gt;窗口减半]\n    E --&gt; B\n    D --&gt; A</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TCPCongestionState {&#10;  cwnd: number;&#10;  ssthresh: number;&#10;  phase: &#39;slow-start&#39; | &#39;congestion-avoidance&#39; | &#39;fast-recovery&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function simulateCongestionControl(initialState: TCPCongestionState, rounds: number): TCPCongestionState[] {&#10;  const history: TCPCongestionState[] = [];&#10;  let state = { ...initialState };&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; rounds; i++) {&#10;    history.push({ ...state });&#10;&#10;    const packetLost = Math.random() &lt; 0.05;&#10;&#10;    if (packetLost) {&#10;      state.ssthresh = Math.floor(state.cwnd / 2);&#10;      state.cwnd = state.ssthresh;&#10;      state.phase = &#39;fast-recovery&#39;;&#10;    } else if (state.phase === &#39;slow-start&#39;) {&#10;      state.cwnd *= 2;&#10;      if (state.cwnd &gt;= state.ssthresh) {&#10;        state.phase = &#39;congestion-avoidance&#39;;&#10;      }&#10;    } else {&#10;      state.cwnd += 1;&#10;      state.phase = &#39;congestion-avoidance&#39;;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return history;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCPCongestionState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cwnd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ssthresh</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  phase</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'slow-start'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'congestion-avoidance'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fast-recovery'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> simulateCongestionControl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">initialState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCPCongestionState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rounds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCPCongestionState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TCPCongestionState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">initialState };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rounds; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    history.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">state });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> packetLost</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (packetLost) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.ssthresh </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(state.cwnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.cwnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.ssthresh;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fast-recovery'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (state.phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'slow-start'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.cwnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (state.cwnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> state.ssthresh) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        state.phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'congestion-avoidance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.cwnd </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      state.phase </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'congestion-avoidance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> history;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"udp-轻量与速度\">UDP：轻量与速度</h2><p>UDP（User Datagram Protocol）是一个极简的传输层协议。没有连接建立、没有可靠性保证、没有拥塞控制——就像寄明信片：发出去就不管了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph TCP&#10;        T1[连接建立] --&gt; T2[有序传输]&#10;        T2 --&gt; T3[确认重传]&#10;        T3 --&gt; T4[拥塞控制]&#10;        T4 --&gt; T5[连接关闭]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph UDP&#10;        U1[直接发送数据报] --&gt; U2[接收方自行处理]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph TCP\n        T1[连接建立] --&gt; T2[有序传输]\n        T2 --&gt; T3[确认重传]\n        T3 --&gt; T4[拥塞控制]\n        T4 --&gt; T5[连接关闭]\n    end\n    subgraph UDP\n        U1[直接发送数据报] --&gt; U2[接收方自行处理]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"tcp-vs-udp\">TCP vs UDP</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>TCP</th>\n<th>UDP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连接方式</td>\n<td>面向连接（三次握手）</td>\n<td>无连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可靠性</td>\n<td>保证送达和顺序</td>\n<td>不保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拥塞控制</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>头部大小</td>\n<td>20-60 字节</td>\n<td>8 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传输模式</td>\n<td>字节流</td>\n<td>数据报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>较高（握手 + 重传）</td>\n<td>较低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>Web、文件传输、邮件</td>\n<td>视频、游戏、DNS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"udp-的适用场景\">UDP 的适用场景</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const UDP_USE_CASES = {&#10;  realTimeGaming: {&#10;    reason: &#39;游戏需要低延迟，丢失一帧画面比延迟一帧更可接受&#39;,&#10;    tolerance: &#39;可容忍少量丢包&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  videoStreaming: {&#10;    reason: &#39;视频流偶尔的画面卡顿好过整体延迟增加&#39;,&#10;    tolerance: &#39;丢包表现为短暂画质下降&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  voip: {&#10;    reason: &#39;语音通话中，重传过期的音频包没有意义&#39;,&#10;    tolerance: &#39;短暂的静音好过延迟的回声&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  dns: {&#10;    reason: &#39;DNS 查询小且简单，不需要建立连接的开销&#39;,&#10;    tolerance: &#39;查询失败可以快速重试&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  iot: {&#10;    reason: &#39;传感器数据高频发送，丢失个别数据点影响不大&#39;,&#10;    tolerance: &#39;周期性数据有天然的冗余&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> UDP_USE_CASES</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  realTimeGaming: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'游戏需要低延迟，丢失一帧画面比延迟一帧更可接受'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tolerance: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'可容忍少量丢包'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  videoStreaming: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'视频流偶尔的画面卡顿好过整体延迟增加'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tolerance: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'丢包表现为短暂画质下降'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  voip: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'语音通话中，重传过期的音频包没有意义'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tolerance: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'短暂的静音好过延迟的回声'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dns: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DNS 查询小且简单，不需要建立连接的开销'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tolerance: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'查询失败可以快速重试'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  iot: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'传感器数据高频发送，丢失个别数据点影响不大'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tolerance: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'周期性数据有天然的冗余'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"websocket-全双工通信\">WebSocket：全双工通信</h2><p>WebSocket 在 TCP 之上提供了全双工的通信通道。与 HTTP 的请求-响应模式不同，WebSocket 连接一旦建立，服务端和客户端可以随时向对方发送消息。</p>\n<h3 id=\"握手过程\">握手过程</h3><p>WebSocket 通过 HTTP 升级握手来建立连接：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: HTTP GET /chat&lt;br/&gt;Upgrade: websocket&lt;br/&gt;Connection: Upgrade&lt;br/&gt;Sec-WebSocket-Key: dGhlIH...&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: HTTP 101 Switching Protocols&lt;br/&gt;Upgrade: websocket&lt;br/&gt;Connection: Upgrade&lt;br/&gt;Sec-WebSocket-Accept: s3pPLM...&#10;    Note over C,S: WebSocket 连接已建立&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: WebSocket 帧(文本/二进制)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: WebSocket 帧(文本/二进制)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: WebSocket 帧(服务端主动推送)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: Ping&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: Pong&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: Close&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;C: Close\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务器\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: HTTP GET /chat&lt;br/&gt;Upgrade: websocket&lt;br/&gt;Connection: Upgrade&lt;br/&gt;Sec-WebSocket-Key: dGhlIH...\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: HTTP 101 Switching Protocols&lt;br/&gt;Upgrade: websocket&lt;br/&gt;Connection: Upgrade&lt;br/&gt;Sec-WebSocket-Accept: s3pPLM...\n    Note over C,S: WebSocket 连接已建立\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: WebSocket 帧(文本/二进制)\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: WebSocket 帧(文本/二进制)\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: WebSocket 帧(服务端主动推送)\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: Ping\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: Pong\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: Close\n    S-&gt;&gt;C: Close</pre><h3 id=\"实现示例\">实现示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { WebSocketServer, WebSocket } from &#39;ws&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface ChatMessage {&#10;  type: &#39;message&#39; | &#39;join&#39; | &#39;leave&#39;;&#10;  userId: string;&#10;  content: string;&#10;  timestamp: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const wss = new WebSocketServer({ port: 8080 });&#10;const clients = new Map&lt;string, WebSocket&gt;();&#10;&#10;wss.on(&#39;connection&#39;, (ws, req) =&gt; {&#10;  const userId = new URL(req.url!, `http://${req.headers.host}`).searchParams.get(&#39;userId&#39;)!;&#10;  clients.set(userId, ws);&#10;&#10;  broadcast({&#10;    type: &#39;join&#39;,&#10;    userId,&#10;    content: `${userId} 加入了聊天室`,&#10;    timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  ws.on(&#39;message&#39;, (data) =&gt; {&#10;    const message: ChatMessage = {&#10;      type: &#39;message&#39;,&#10;      userId,&#10;      content: data.toString(),&#10;      timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;    };&#10;    broadcast(message);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  ws.on(&#39;close&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    clients.delete(userId);&#10;    broadcast({&#10;      type: &#39;leave&#39;,&#10;      userId,&#10;      content: `${userId} 离开了聊天室`,&#10;      timestamp: Date.now(),&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  ws.on(&#39;pong&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    (ws as any).isAlive = true;&#10;  });&#10;});&#10;&#10;function broadcast(message: ChatMessage): void {&#10;  const data = JSON.stringify(message);&#10;  for (const client of clients.values()) {&#10;    if (client.readyState === WebSocket.OPEN) {&#10;      client.send(data);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;setInterval(() =&gt; {&#10;  for (const [userId, ws] of clients) {&#10;    if ((ws as any).isAlive === false) {&#10;      clients.delete(userId);&#10;      ws.terminate();&#10;      return;&#10;    }&#10;    (ws as any).isAlive = false;&#10;    ws.ping();&#10;  }&#10;}, 30000);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { WebSocketServer, WebSocket } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ws'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</spa